# Copy this file to .env.local (already gitignored) and fill in your key to
# enable the live Gemini-backed AI Support and Retrieval Practice comparison.
# Leave it unset and both features keep using their mock/placeholder
# implementations — the app works fine without this file.
#
# Get a free-tier key at https://aistudio.google.com/apikey
#
# SECURITY: this key is bundled into the client-side build and readable by
# anyone who opens dev tools. Use it for local development only. For a
# deployed build, DON'T set VITE_GEMINI_API_KEY in Vercel: set GEMINI_API_KEY
# and ACCESS_CODES there instead (server-side proxy, see api/gemini.ts and
# the README's "Live LLM API integration" section).
VITE_GEMINI_API_KEY=

# Optional, defaults to gemini-3.6-flash (Gemini's free-tier flash model).
# VITE_GEMINI_MODEL=gemini-3.6-flash
